  "permalink": "nastydreams",
  "description": "If you hear me play, just know…\nwe’re probably dreaming the same dream.\n\nI’m NastyDreams, born in Bucharest, built from neon nights, loud emotions, and music that hits deeper at 3AM.\n\nProgressive trance and mainstage are my escape, my therapy, and my chaos all at once. \n\nI live for the moments when the lights blind you, the bass shakes your chest, and thousands of strangers feel the exact same emotion together.\n\nTattoos, dark energy, soft heart.\n\nI turn memories into melodies and sleepless nights into soundtracks.",
